	(text "REFLECTOR B card (U).  Passive: the outbound end of the stack turns around here.\nR[A..Z] = YRUHQSLDPXNGOKMIEBFZCWVJAT   (an involution without fixed points)\nJ3 pin i+1 (outbound line i) is wired to J2 pin R[i]+1 (return line R[i]); net RF_<in><out>.\nOnly two connectors: J3 at the shifter's J3 position, J2 at its J2 position (README.md section 2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
